 genius back then, but he died young, at the age of 21. He went in the district. He was messing around with them women, and he got one of them AIDS diseases, something like that. He didn't tell his people what he had, because he was so highly respected for them, he was ashamed of himself. Whenever they did get to him, ...", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q14046$040C2261-86AA-43F4-AF98-181D599F645C", "rank": "normal"}], "P20": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P20", "hash": "1fee28680b09ed0fb12687437ec2c6d5d51f3213", "datavalue": {"value": "https://semlab.s3.amazonaws.com/texts/eb031d08a1a7e4523782556da91b06a1/480.txt", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "url"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q14046$88ED7D23-2A94-4F97-88F3-B7FDE042C9A3", "rank": "normal"}], "P21": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "1582d904e1e9ed564d6382dd8bc451282c53741b", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1516, "id": "Q1516"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q14046$ACD8FF48-9908-46D5-BE96-D58FAFC783E3", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "38fa88134644407e366b9c056015248deef7cd8b", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1590, "id": "Q1590"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q14046$27FE8CC7-7327-4D4E-871E-6FAB53FB79B6", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "444c709588611082b0c0995985bbcfec69e10c33", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1592, "id": "Q1592"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q14046$ACCB8FF8-2AE8-4328-A74B-E8B6E0AC8AEB", "rank": "normal"}], "P22": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P22", "hash": "1716bcd35dbd3cdf7e1e2be8ef5fe8839edc6759", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type"